# Copy to .env.local and uncomment what you want to change. Without it the app uses the live NTER
# project (defaults in src/lib/config.js). The publishable key is public by design (every
# nter.pro page ships it); row-level security protects the data. Never put a secret key here.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://vfgcppstyzjarlzyqdac.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_9X9OJnXkf-UuJcVvsY13nA_J_7oJ_-I
# Where the phone apps reach nter.pro's public API:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://www.nter.pro
# Where a browser build reaches it (empty = same site; vercel.json rewrites /api to nter.pro):
# VITE_WEB_API_BASE=
# live (default) | sample — sample runs the whole app on the bundled read-only snapshot, offline.
# VITE_DATA_MODE=live
# 1 once the research-chat function's ALLOWED_ORIGINS lists https://app.nter.pro and capacitor://app.nter.pro
# VITE_STREAM_CHAT=0
